After a long shift at the lab, and having made many visits to the bridge to report L3XA’s progress, I finally got a few hours to sleep.
audio music "res://arts/musics/music.wav" [fade="1.0" volume="-0.6000000000000001" loop="true"]
[background arg="res://arts/splash art/backgrounds/galaxia.png" fade="0.0"]
In a dreamy state, I feel myself floating away in an infinitely expanding open space.
I am surrounded by stars, galaxies, and everything is silent around me. I see colors that I’ve never seen before. My body is naked, and the air is warm.
stranger: I like coming here too.
I didn't expect the voice that spoke to me.
It caresses my ear, disembodied, making my skin crawl. I know now that there is somebody else with me here, only I can’t see them.
stranger: I like coming here when things down there become too difficult.
